{"id":"P058-2","subject":"P","unit":"P058","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P058-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n60Hz, 6극, 174kW의 3상 유도전동기의 전부하 2차\n\n동손이 20kW, 기계손이 6kW라고 할 때, 전부하 회\n\n전수rpm는?\n\n\n① 960          ② 1080\n\n③ 1188         ④ 1120","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":741},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m26-e2.webp","width":696,"height":551}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n200F의 콘덴서에 5ms동안 0~5V의 전압을 가할\n\n때, 작용하는 전류mA는?\n\n\n① 150         ② 200\n\n③ 250         ④ 300","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":671}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n3상 선로에서 선간전압 200V, 역률 80, 전력손실이\n\n100kW일 때, 선전류A 는?\n\n                      \n①            ②    \n\n    \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":553},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":437}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n200kVA 의 전력을 공급받는 부하의 역률이 0.6인 경우,\n\n부하의 무효전력kVar은?\n\n\n① 120         ② 140\n\n③ 160         ④ 180","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":365},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":227}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n1W의 부하를 시간 사용할 때, 전력량Wh은?                  \n\n(단, 부하역률은 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.4\n\n③ 0.5          ④ 0.8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":234}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n어떤 회로에 200V, 50A 를 가할 때, 소비전력이\n\n8kW였다. 이 회로의 리액턴스Ω는?\n\n\n① 2.4          ② 2.8\n\n③ 3.2          ④ 3.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":604}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n3상 부하가 △결선되었을 때 상에는 컨덕턴스 0.9,\n\n상에는 컨덕턴스 0.9, 상은 유도 서셉턴스 0.9가\n\n연결되어 있다. 이 부하의 영상 어드미턴스는?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1045}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 s에서 스위치 를 닫을 때,\n회로에 흐르는 전류는? (단, V이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①          ② \n③          ④                                ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":760},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1292}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n분포정수 회로에 있어서 선로의 단위 길이당 저항이\n\n100Ωm, 인덕턴스가 300mHm, 누설 컨덕턴스가\n\n0.3일 때, 일그러짐이 없는 조건(무왜형 조건)을\n\n만족하기 위한 단위 길이당 커패시턴스는 몇 Fm인가?\n\n\n① 300         ② 600\n\n③ 900         ④ 1200","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m34-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":590}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음의 회로를 테브난 등가회로로 변환할 때, 테브난\n등가전압V과, 등가저항 Ω은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 4V, 2Ω      ② 4V, 4Ω\n\n③ 8V, 2Ω      ④ 8V, 4Ω","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":600},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":406}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n다음과 같은 직렬회로에서 저항이 Ω, 유도성\n\n리액턴스가 Ω, 용량성 리액턴스가 Ω일 때,\n\n회로에 흐르는 전류A 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 12          ② 14\n\n③ 16          ④ 20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":884},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":551}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n다음의 회로에서 단자 와  사이의 전압 V는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 8           ④ 12","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":998},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":926},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m37-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\nΩ, H,     F인 직렬회로에              \n             V의 전압을 가할 때, 전류A는?sin\n\n①  sin             ②  sin\n\n③                         sin           ④                 sin  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":732},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1410}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n복도체에서 소도체의 반지름이 3mm, 소도체 중심간격\n\n이 30cm일 때, 복도체의 등가반지름cm은?\n\n\n① 3           ② 6\n\n③ 9           ④ 15","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m39","number":39,"note":"원본 정답표에서 복원한 정답입니다."},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m39-e1.webp","width":678,"height":472}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n3상 송전선로의 전압이 kV, 주파수가 Hz,\n\n                                         \n선로의 길이가 km, 1선당 정전용량이     Fkm          \n일 때, 무부하 충전전류A 는?\n\n\n① 12          ② 18\n\n③ 24          ④ 36","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m40-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1148}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n3상 3선식 송전선로에서 송전거리가 일정하며, 송전하는\n\n전력의 크기가 동일할 때, 전력손실()과 전압()의\n\n관계는?\n\n\n① ∝        ② ∝\n\n                                \n③ ∝       ④ ∝","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m41-q.webp","width":696,"height":652},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m41-e1.webp","width":696,"height":734}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n3상 3선식 송전선로에서 각 선의 대지정전용량이 0.65F\n\n이고, 선간의 정전용량이 0.15F일 때, 1선의 작용 정전\n\n용량F은?\n\n\n① 1.1          ② 1.25\n\n③ 1.5          ④ 1.75","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":575}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n송전계통에서 공진현상을 막고, 고조파 전류를 경감하는\n\n목적으로 콘덴서에 직렬로 리액터를 접속하는데, 리액터가\n\n제거하는 고조파는 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 제2고조파       ② 제3고조파\n\n③ 제4고조파       ④ 제5고조파","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m43-q.webp","width":696,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":524}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n선로의 직렬 임피던스를 Ω, 병렬 어드미턴스를 \n\n라 할 때, 특성 임피던스와 전파정수는?\n\n\n\n      특성 임피던스       전파정수\n\n           ①                  \n                               \n ②         \n\n         ③                  \n\n                        ④                   ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":688},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":784}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n3상 3선식 선로에 다음과 같은 조건의 3상 평형부하가 접\n\n속되었을 때, 송전단 전압V은?\n\n(단, 선로의 저항은 4Ω, 리액턴스는 8Ω이다.)\n\n       ⦁수전단 전압  : 6.6kV\n       ⦁지상역률 80\n\n       ⦁부하용량 660kW\n\n① 7000         ② 7200\n\n③ 7400         ④ 7600","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":638},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m45-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1279}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n퍼센트 임피던스 와 전력kW, 전압kV와의\n\n관계는?\n\n\n① 는 에 비례, 에 반비례한다.\n② 는 에 비례, 에 비례한다.\n③ 는 에 반비례, 에 비례한다.\n④ 는 에 반비례, 에 반비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m46-q.webp","width":678,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m46-e1.webp","width":696,"height":603}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n다음 설명에 대한 ㉠, ㉡은?\n\n  ⦁( ㉠   )  : 전력선과 통신선과의 상호 인덕턴스와\n\n        영상전류에 의해 통신선에 전압이 유도\n\n        되어 일어나는 장해를 말한다.\n\n  ⦁( ㉡   )  : 전력선과 통신선과의 상호 정전용량과\n\n        영상전압에 의해 통신선에 전압이 유도\n\n        되어 일어나는 장해를 말한다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①    전자 유도장해      정전 유도장해\n\n ②    정전 유도장해      전자 유도장해\n\n ③    전자 유도장해      전력 유도장해\n\n ④   고조파 유도장해     전력 유도장해","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m47-q.webp","width":696,"height":703},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m47-e1.webp","width":678,"height":585}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n다이오드로 2개로 구성된 단상전파 정류회로에서 부하에\n\n직류전압 100V를 공급하기 위해 필요한 단상 교류전압\n\n의 실횻값V과 다이오드의 V는?\n\n\n\n     단상 교류전압V           V\n ①                         \n ②                         \n ③                         \n ④                         ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m48-q.webp","width":696,"height":584},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m48-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1297},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m48-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 49번","searchText":" 49\n\n다음의 계전기 동작특성에 해당하는 것은?\n\n  ⦁( ㉠   )  : 설정된 최소 동작전류 이상의 전류가\n\n        흐르면 즉시 동작하는 계전기이다.\n\n  ⦁( ㉡   )  : 설정된 값 이상의 전류가 흘렀을 때,\n\n        동작시간이 전류값에 반비례하여 동작\n\n        하는 계전기이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①    순한시 계전기      정한시 계전기\n\n ②    순한시 계전기      반한시 계전기\n\n ③    정한시 계전기      반한시 계전기\n\n ④    정한시 계전기      순한시 계전기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m49","number":49},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m49-q.webp","width":696,"height":596},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m49-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S2-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 50번","searchText":" 50\n\n3상 배전선로의 말단에 지상역률 60, 120kW의\n\n평형 3상 부하가 있다. 부하점에 부하와 병렬로 전력용\n\n콘덴서를 접속하여 선로손실을 최소화 하고자 할 때\n\n필요한 콘덴서의 용량kVA은?\n\n(단, 부하단의 전압은 일정하다.)\n\n\n① 80          ② 120\n\n③ 160         ④ 200","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m50","number":50},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m50-q.webp","width":678,"height":1881},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m50-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
